# atom order after Irregular migration (misc suite, section 7): displace_atoms
# moves atoms across several sub-domains; the unsorted dump records the local
# order of the atoms on every rank
atom_style granular
atom_modify map array sort 0 0.0
boundary p p p
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region dom block 0 0.04 0 0.04 0 0.04 units box
create_box 1 dom
lattice sc 0.002
create_atoms 1 box
set group all diameter 0.001 density 2500
displace_atoms all random 0.015 0.015 0.015 49979687 units box
neighbor 0.0005 bin
fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 5.e6
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.45
fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.3
fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.5
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history
pair_coeff * *
dump d all custom 1 order.txt id
run 0
